  "description": "The Patient Triage System helps healthcare professionals prioritize patients based on the severity of their condition. This system ensures that critical cases receive immediate attention while less severe cases are managed accordingly.\n\nThe system evaluates four critical factors:\n\nVital Signs – Assesses parameters like heart rate, blood pressure, and oxygen levels.\nSymptoms Severity – Determines if the symptoms are mild, moderate, or severe.\nMedical History – Considers pre-existing conditions that could worsen the situation.\nConsciousness Level – Identifies if the patient is fully alert, drowsy, or unconscious.",
